        "### 2.5.2 Removal of Monetary\n",
        "\n",
        "I refit the chosen Ward RFM solution using only Recency and Frequency, on the same shares and the same\n",
        "number of clusters, re-standardising the two-feature matrix from scratch. I compared the new memberships\n",
        "against the full solution with the adjusted Rand index, and I looked at the traded-value profile of each\n",
        "group. A high ARI means Monetary mostly repeated what R and F already said, a low ARI means it separated\n",
        "shares by liquidity in its own right."
